 I like to use it just to shut  everyone up and I'll cross my arms  standing up silently and just shake my  head at redstone there's a long  multiplayer history a lot of different  types of multiplayer games and what VR  brings to us now a new way to let  players interact with each other so  wearables within this is social around  the table experience that's very  discussion and personality they  we're working on things that give other  types of player interaction in VR and we  have a lot of exciting ideas and expect  a lot of great things to come out of  here in the next few years
 

